  "description": "Physical education teacher Ho-Jin and school nurse Si-Won are childhood friends who work in the same school! Si-Won looks after Ho-Jin, who always has a lot of work. One day, Ho-Jin suffers from leg cramps during class and receives a massage from Si-Won. But the moment Si-Won's hand touches his leg, Ho-Jin feels it?! \n\nA candid body conversation between two childhood friends begins! \n\n(Source: Manyeo Comics, translated)",
